SUMMARY:Take the Cold Plunge Challenge on World Menopause Day!
DESCRIPTION:Menopause influences 70% of age-related diseases\, yet less than 1% of preclinical aging studies worldwide consider menopause in their research.\nThat’s why Sinai Health Foundation is inviting you to be bold\, get cold and make a difference for women’s health by joining the Cold Plunge Challenge on Sunday\, October 18th. You can plunge on your own at home\, at your local spa or gym\, or join us at Woodbine Beach for a community plunge in Lake Ontario.\nRegistration for the in-person event is $15/person. Fundraising is encouraged to support research that aims to improve care and health outcomes for women\, now and for the future.\nHelp us transform care for women at every stage of life. Register today.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/take-the-cold-plunge-challenge-on-world-menopause-day/
LOCATION:Woodbine Beach\, 1675 Lakeshore Blvd E\, Toronto\, M4L 3W6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06144458/BR0214-2026-EventListing_BlogTO_1000px_FINAL.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Sinai Health Foundation":MAILTO:events@sinaihealthfoundation.ca
END:VEVENT
